{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/PK_bannerNew_combined.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of park manager and design the ultimate zoo for nature's greatest creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover, incubate and release dozens of extinct species to build a successful park that can keep up with the growing demands of guests, staff and hungry animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/TreeDivider.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_grow2.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the majestic Woolly Mammoth to the mighty Spinosaurus, undo the rules of extinction by reviving a diverse selection of over 50 species of prehistoric wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch as they seamlessly grow from baby to adult; changing their proportions, sounds and behaviors in realtime. They'll need to eat, drink, sleep and satisfy their social needs through dynamic behaviors like herding and socialization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/PK_animalbanner.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_build2.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design  stunning parks across an enormous playable area to draw in crowds from all over the world. Carve rivers, raise mountains or build facilities piece-by-piece with precise creative tools.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a selection of themed prefabs or use the Steam Workshop to share or download ready-made structures like restaurants, toilets and viewing platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/TreeDivider.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_manage2.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare your zoo with logistics management, strategically placing key infrastructure  to optimize its efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Import or generate resources and deliver them throughout the zoo with trainable staff to\u00a0ensure your kiosks and feeders remain stocked. Don't forget to clean those dung piles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/TreeDivider.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_explore.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get up close and personal with <strong>First Person Mode</strong> and explore your zoo from a different persective. Take a look through binoculars, enter habitats or even stop to sit  on a bench with this immersive and interactive mode. </p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/666150?t=1745580648","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745580648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/b17cfb62a3d58807fb340edf305e8e48c91e8f70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745580648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/b17cfb62a3d58807fb340edf305e8e48c91e8f70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745580648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Crytivo Featured Games</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/PK_bannerNew_combined.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of park manager and design the ultimate zoo for nature's greatest creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover, incubate and release dozens of extinct species to build a successful park that can keep up with the growing demands of guests, staff and hungry animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/TreeDivider.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_grow2.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the majestic Woolly Mammoth to the mighty Spinosaurus, undo the rules of extinction by reviving a diverse selection of over 50 species of prehistoric wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch as they seamlessly grow from baby to adult; changing their proportions, sounds and behaviors in realtime. They'll need to eat, drink, sleep and satisfy their social needs through dynamic behaviors like herding and socialization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/PK_animalbanner.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_build2.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design  stunning parks across an enormous playable area to draw in crowds from all over the world. Carve rivers, raise mountains or build facilities piece-by-piece with precise creative tools.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a selection of themed prefabs or use the Steam Workshop to share or download ready-made structures like restaurants, toilets and viewing platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/TreeDivider.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_manage2.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare your zoo with logistics management, strategically placing key infrastructure  to optimize its efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Import or generate resources and deliver them throughout the zoo with trainable staff to\u00a0ensure your kiosks and feeders remain stocked. Don't forget to clean those dung piles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/TreeDivider.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/extras/steamHeaders_explore.png?t=1745580648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get up close and personal with <strong>First Person Mode</strong> and explore your zoo from a different persective. Take a look through binoculars, enter habitats or even stop to sit  on a bench with this immersive and interactive mode. </p>","developers":["Blue Meridian"],"dlc":[2562770,2563080],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/666150/d43eb387e2f3a41014ee39d8d70918710a6db2e4/header.jpg?t=1745580648","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 GHz Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics 640<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Intel i5 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130427,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130427/movie480.mp4?t=1745509770","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130427/movie_max.mp4?t=1745509770"},"name":"Prehistoric Kingdom: Update 14 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130427/f822c59b5cbaf5207809b04050303f8df3c59169/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745509770","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130427/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745509770","max":"http://video.akamai.steams